[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrispbsmolen/ca-tools/issues/comments/6752040502","html_url":"https://github.com/chrispbsmolen/ca-tools/issues/62#issuecomment-6752040502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrispbsmolen/ca-tools/issues/62","id":6752040502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOTsvulc8AAAABknP2Ng","user":{"login":"chrispbsmolen","id":205388779,"node_id":"U_kgDODD376w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205388779?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen","html_url":"https://github.com/chrispbsmolen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-09T21:33:50Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T21:33:50Z","body":"Hi Arhan, thank you. You are right, and your numbers match what I get from the files. Past every counted row of a strength and alphabet, a fused size should not be called best known when a rule in derived.csv gives a smaller size at that width or wider. From this build a fused size there counts only if no rule in derived.csv, checked or not, gives less. The unchecked rules are used only to remove a size, never to add one. Today that removes the ten lines at strength 3 with 2 and 3 symbols past 10,000 columns. The fused sizes of your families at the ten alphabets from #54 all stay, for example CA(11889; 3, 100000, 10). At some widths derived.csv is still lower, by up to 10 percent (24 symbols, 17,333 to 17,500 columns: 84,909 against 93,623), and that closes as rules are checked. Please send your strength-2 rows. Each one past 20,000 columns I will compare with derived.csv by hand before it is merged. Yes, I would like the CSV. Please attach it here. It will be the test that checks the build at every width, and the change log credits it.\n\n-Christopher","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrispbsmolen/ca-tools/issues/comments/6752040502/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrispbsmolen/ca-tools/issues/comments/6755177101","html_url":"https://github.com/chrispbsmolen/ca-tools/issues/62#issuecomment-6755177101","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrispbsmolen/ca-tools/issues/62","id":6755177101,"node_id":"IC_kwDOTsvulc8AAAABkqPSjQ","user":{"login":"chrispbsmolen","id":205388779,"node_id":"U_kgDODD376w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/205388779?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen","html_url":"https://github.com/chrispbsmolen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrispbsmolen/received_events","type":"Us